<!--
  English (default) strings. Every user-visible text lives here, with Catalan in
  values-ca/ and Spanish in values-es/. Keep the three files in the same order.

  Style: Catalan uses the imperative for actions ("Descarrega", "Cancel·la");
  Spanish uses the infinitive ("Descargar", "Cancelar"). Spanish follows the
  Grimmory web app's terms (estante, estante mágico, marcador, editorial).
-->
